<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swisher said rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swisher said rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter initiated coverage of Swisher International Group Inc with a buy recommendation, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/4 to 16-1/4 in early NYSE trade.</p>
</text>
